              },
              {
                "title": "Letter Uu",
                "content": "Sound /ʌ/ as in up, run.",
                "difficulty": "1",
                "children": []
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Grammar: Simple present and imperatives",
            "content": "Learn to use simple present for colours and imperatives for suggestions.",
            "difficulty": "2",
            "children": [
